# Line endings stay LF in every checkout, Windows included, so hashes, quotes in tests and the release manifest
# match on every machine. Windows batch and PowerShell files keep CRLF, which cmd.exe needs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.onnx binary
